This artificial Christmas tree features a realistic full spruce design, crafted from durable plastic to recreate the natural charm of authentic festive greenery. The dense foliage creates a rich, inviting atmosphere for your home decorations during the holiday season.

With 1814 densely packed tips across a 99 cm width, this tree offers impressive fullness that surpasses standard models with fewer branches. The lush silhouette provides a beautiful focal point, ensuring your festive display looks abundant and professionally styled.

Assembly is quick and tool-free thanks to the simple sectioned design with hinged and moulded branches requiring minimal shaping. You can set up this six-foot tree in approximately fifteen to twenty minutes, allowing more time for family festivities and celebrations.

The branches are flame-retardant, offering safe enjoyment near fireplaces or warm lighting without concerns about fire hazards. This tested safety feature ensures peace of mind while you decorate, making it suitable for placing beside heat sources in your living space.

A reinforced metal base keeps the tree stable and upright, preventing tipping while supporting its height and weight effectively. The foldable stand design allows for incredibly easy storage once the festivities are over, preserving the tree for use in future holiday seasons.
